<para>Passed to <ref refid="classthemis_1_1wire_1_1_wire_protocol_server" kindref="compound">WireProtocolServer</ref> at construction time and forwarded to each new <ref refid="classthemis_1_1wire_1_1_wire_protocol_session" kindref="compound">WireProtocolSession</ref>. All fields are optional shared_ptrs; a null pointer keeps the corresponding handler returning a redirect error. </para>
